{"id":"wb-1-16","name":"广州公社旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广州起义纪念馆","text":"广州起义纪念馆，即广州公社旧址，为原中华民国国民政府广东省会公安局，位于中华人民共和国广东省广州市越秀区起义路200号之一，是1927年12月时由中国共产党的张太雷领导发动的广州暴动而建立的苏维埃政府——广州公社所在。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E9%A6%86","revisionId":93666593,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93666593","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/33b3e028318bba1477b57071.jpg","title":"Gzqiyi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gzqiyi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/Gzqiyi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Chintunglee","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​广州起义纪念馆","width":320,"height":240}}